<p>One of the biggest reasons Kenyan brands fall off social media is a lack of planning. You start strong in January, run out of ideas by week three, and by February the page goes quiet. This 30-day content calendar solves that problem permanently. Use it every month as a repeatable system that keeps your content consistent, strategic and sales-focused.</p>

<h2>How to Use This Calendar</h2>

<p>This calendar is built around the <strong>4-pillar content framework</strong>: Educate, Entertain, Inspire and Convert. Each week distributes content across all four pillars so your audience never feels "sold to" too hard, but also never goes a week without a clear call to action.</p>

<p>Before you start, define these for your brand:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Your primary platform (Instagram, Facebook or both)</li>
  <li>Your posting frequency (we recommend 5x/week minimum)</li>
  <li>Your brand voice (professional, casual, humorous, inspirational)</li>
  <li>Your 3 core content themes (e.g. for a restaurant: food, team culture, customer stories)</li>
</ul>

